LOCUS       4753_v5lp_phru3_forind-extgag_S215P_RSV_Long_F_VBOpt 11792 bp ds-DNA     circular     16-MAY-2024
DEFINITION  .
COMMENT     Based on 4738_v5lp_phru3_forind-extgag_RSV_Long_F_VBOpt but with 
            S215P stabilizing mutant in RSV F. Designed by Cassie, cloned by 
            Teagan in May 2024. V5 landing pad-compatible pHrU3 ForInducible vector
            containing Extended Gag (Humes) with RSV Long F codon optimized by
            VectorBuilder cloned from a synthesized gene fragment. Plasmid was
            generated by digesting p4016 with AscI/MluI and combining with RSV
            fragment via HiFi Assembly. Sequence validated using Primordium
            whole plasmid sequencing.
